  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5095f5bb01075e14285e8eb5c1d65cde, type: 3}
  m_Name: LTC_Cat_EN
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  WelcomeText: "Welcome to Cloudveil Realm.\LLike Earth, it has plants, minerals,
    and hidden forms of life\u2014but their nature differs from what we know. In
    Cloudveil, the boundary between living and non-living is blurred. Most entities
    appear as geometric forms, where shape is not just appearance, but a transferable
    state between matter and consciousness."
  DescriptionText: "The creature you\u2019re holding is called Floatite.\LIt is one
    of the most common beings in the Cloudveil Realm. Its appearance closely resembles
    the surrounding minerals; when still, it almost completely blends into nearby
    rocks, making it hard to distinguish.\nFloatites do not walk. Instead, they float
    through the air, gently rising or drifting along air currents. Their vocalizations
    are very similar to those of a cat. When deeply asleep, their ears fold down
    and their body returns to a mineral-like, motionless state.\nYou may gently press
    or lightly shake it. If it feels uncomfortable, it will protest through sound
    and color\u2014at this moment, look at its face and calm it. If treated roughly
    for too long, the Floatite will quietly withdraw itself, leaving behind only
    a lingering sense of touch."
  EndingText: "You are about to leave Cloudveil Realm.\LPlease take a moment to reflect
    on the sensations, sounds, and responses you experienced during the interaction.\LWe
    will ask you a few questions next, and you are very welcome to share any feelings
    or impressions you found especially meaningful."
